{\b STORM OS}\par\par
By installing STORM OS you agree to the license terms published at https://stormos.app/legal/license and to the privacy notice at https://stormos.app/legal/privacy.\par\par
{\b What this installer does}\par
\bullet  Installs the STORM OS app, the STORM OS Service (StormOSService, runs as LocalSystem) and the storm command-line tool into the selected folder.\par
\bullet  Adds a Start menu shortcut and adds the installation folder to the system PATH for the storm command.\par
\bullet  Does not change any Windows setting. System changes are only made later, inside the app, after you confirm each one; every change is backed up and can be restored.\par
\bullet  Uninstall removes the program, the service, the shortcut and the PATH entry. Your history and restore points are kept in %LOCALAPPDATA%\\StormOS and %ProgramData%\\StormOS until you delete them.\par
}
